# AVV Contracts Storage

This directory contains signed Data Processing Agreements (AVV/DPA) with third-party processors.

## Files
- `hetzner-avv-signed.pdf` - Signed AVV with Hetzner (hosting provider)
- `stripe-dpa-signed.pdf` - Signed DPA with Stripe (payment processor)

## Security Note
These contracts contain company information. Ensure this directory is properly secured and backed up.
